  "details": "I can see the camera's UI text through the camera frame in a personal mirror in VR mode.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. (Optional) To make this potentially easier, lie down in VR (with full body tracking).\n\n2. Enable personal mirror.\n\n3. Take out a camera.\n\n4. Rotate/pan the camera and mirror in your hands.\n\nExpected behavior: The camera UI text is blocked by the camera frame in the personal mirror. The text is not seen through the camera frame when held in hand, without a mirror.\n\nActual behavior:  The camera UI text is rendered through the camera frame in the personal mirror. The text is not seen through the camera frame when held in hand, without a mirror.",
